(6096818, 898099, 17507, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Love the rising mist. But why is the white stroke thicker on the bottom?</td>', 'Great shot! Love the rising mist. But why is the white stroke thicker on the bottom?', '2010-07-19 02:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
