(6096838, 898132, 109478, '<td valign="top">Great job! I tried this but failed. It is nearly impossible to achieve such a photo without equipments like Cognisys StopShot module, and I believe that it is still not easy even with the StopShot module, so you really did a good job.<br/>Comparing this photo with the original, the umbrella shape in original looks better. Besides, since it is an advanced editing challenge, you could remove the tiny dust on the cup. Finally, the light on the rim of the cup is hard for my taste and I prefer the softer tone in original. In conclusion, I give the original 9 and give yours 7.</td>', 'Great job! I tried this but failed. It is nearly impossible to achieve such a photo without equipments like Cognisys StopShot module, and I believe that it is still not easy even with the StopShot module, so you really did a good job.Comparing this photo with the original, the umbrella shape in original looks better. Besides, since it is an advanced editing challenge, you could remove the tiny dust on the cup. Finally, the light on the rim of the cup is hard for my taste and I prefer the softer tone in original. In conclusion, I give the original 9 and give yours 7.', '2010-07-19 03:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6096840, 898140, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  I like the focus on the eyes this time around.  Great eye contact.</td>', 'Nice portrait.  I like the focus on the eyes this time around.  Great eye contact.', '2010-07-19 03:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6096844, 898103, 103032, '<td valign="top">This version is excellent.  Great colors, gives the scene life.  I like the "angle" of this shot compared to the original; I like how the road gently bends to the left instead of straight down in the original.  Nice job.</td>', 'This version is excellent.  Great colors, gives the scene life.  I like the "angle" of this shot compared to the original; I like how the road gently bends to the left instead of straight down in the original.  Nice job.', '2010-07-19 03:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
