(6097002, 897984, 117474, '<td valign="top">Haha. Awesome! That really made me chuckle. I was wondering if someone would be doing this and was delighted someone did!<br/> <br/>(Being ultra-critical cause I can''t see anything at all wrong with it) the original was very very soft all over. I think the textures of the cloth on the left and top left are maybe a bit rough for this picture. The textures in the SIENA were... different and I think (in a comparison sense) that it suited the shot better. <br/>Love the eyes. Great prop replication.</td>', 'Haha. Awesome! That really made me chuckle. I was wondering if someone would be doing this and was delighted someone did! (Being ultra-critical cause I can''t see anything at all wrong with it) the original was very very soft all over. I think the textures of the cloth on the left and top left are maybe a bit rough for this picture. The textures in the SIENA were... different and I think (in a comparison sense) that it suited the shot better. Love the eyes. Great prop replication.', '2010-07-19 08:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6097025, 898178, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great take on the entry. The colors and details in this photo are outstanding.</td>', 'Great take on the entry. The colors and details in this photo are outstanding.', '2010-07-19 09:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6097027, 898187, 114225, '<td valign="top">Almost a perfect replica. It''s interesting how your version is so much sharper. Actually, as I compare, I kind of like the softness of the original a tiny bit better.</td>', 'Almost a perfect replica. It''s interesting how your version is so much sharper. Actually, as I compare, I kind of like the softness of the original a tiny bit better.', '2010-07-19 09:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6097058, 898118, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good job with the recreation.  Two things I think could have made this better: if the green liquid was more of a birhgt green. IF there wasn''t that black bar in the background.</td>', 'Good job with the recreation.  Two things I think could have made this better: if the green liquid was more of a birhgt green. IF there wasn''t that black bar in the background.', '2010-07-19 10:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6097059, 898243, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting rethought of the entry. I really like the depth of field used to bring out the textures of the leaf.</td>', 'Interesting rethought of the entry. I really like the depth of field used to bring out the textures of the leaf.', '2010-07-19 10:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6097060, 897983, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool re-creation of the original. I do like the colors and sense of mystery to this version. But I like the leading lines of the other. In my mind, both are equally good.</td>', 'Cool re-creation of the original. I do like the colors and sense of mystery to this version. But I like the leading lines of the other. In my mind, both are equally good.', '2010-07-19 10:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6097061, 898259, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great recreation. The colors in your photo are much more pleasing.</td>', 'Great recreation. The colors in your photo are much more pleasing.', '2010-07-19 10:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6097062, 897883, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ooh, I really like what the color adds to this photo. There are so many great details that you have brought out.</td>', 'Ooh, I really like what the color adds to this photo. There are so many great details that you have brought out.', '2010-07-19 10:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6097065, 898132, 67697, '<td valign="top">wow you chose a tough one to redo - a ribbon winner!  maybe this is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114969" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">gyaban</a> himself since the type of lighting is similar.  what i like about this one compared to the original is that the focus seems to be more on the drops instead of the cup (as is in the original).  i like how the color of light is a great contrast to the color of the cup.</td>', 'wow you chose a tough one to redo - a ribbon winner!  maybe this is  gyaban himself since the type of lighting is similar.  what i like about this one compared to the original is that the focus seems to be more on the drops instead of the cup (as is in the original).  i like how the color of light is a great contrast to the color of the cup.', '2010-07-19 10:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6097071, 898254, 67697, '<td valign="top">wow this is pretty darn close to the original. the shards look about the same so maybe this is indeed <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=52500" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">freakin_hilarious</a>. If it is, I think it is funny that you still have this glass :)<br/> <br/>I like your take on this.  The edgier colortone seems to suit the piece.  I like how the focus on the glass seems to be sharper too.  Nice re-do.</td>', 'wow this is pretty darn close to the original. the shards look about the same so maybe this is indeed  freakin_hilarious. If it is, I think it is funny that you still have this glass :) I like your take on this.  The edgier colortone seems to suit the piece.  I like how the focus on the glass seems to be sharper too.  Nice re-do.', '2010-07-19 10:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6097111, 898038, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo. I assume this is based on "Forest Spirit masquerading as Chickaree." It''s interesting that you went with such a different subject. I will score this high on clarity/composition, but a bit lower due to weak link to the original.</td>', 'This is a great photo. I assume this is based on "Forest Spirit masquerading as Chickaree." It''s interesting that you went with such a different subject. I will score this high on clarity/composition, but a bit lower due to weak link to the original.', '2010-07-19 11:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6097113, 898181, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice re-creation. You definitely added your own flare, and improved upon the composition and lighting over the original.</td>', 'Nice re-creation. You definitely added your own flare, and improved upon the composition and lighting over the original.', '2010-07-19 11:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6097114, 898235, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great re-creation. The angle and positioning of the forks is almost exactly the same. Good lighting and textures to the metal.</td>', 'Great re-creation. The angle and positioning of the forks is almost exactly the same. Good lighting and textures to the metal.', '2010-07-19 11:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6097116, 898236, 114225, '<td valign="top">Fantastic recreation of that shot. Good clarity to the water and great setup.</td>', 'Fantastic recreation of that shot. Good clarity to the water and great setup.', '2010-07-19 11:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6097117, 898092, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. It''s really interesting how the different lighting can bring out different details in each shot.</td>', 'Nice photo. It''s really interesting how the different lighting can bring out different details in each shot.', '2010-07-19 11:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6097120, 898145, 114225, '<td valign="top">I haven''t yet been able to find the original, but this is a really nice photo. Wonderful lighting to set the mood.</td>', 'I haven''t yet been able to find the original, but this is a really nice photo. Wonderful lighting to set the mood.', '2010-07-19 11:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
