(6097128, 898232, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m not able to find the original on this one. Overall, this is an ok photo. Some things that could help it be better: Less distracting background, especially the lighter areas (to get this, you could have cropped and then used some advanced editing techniques to turn down background brightness).</td>', 'I''m not able to find the original on this one. Overall, this is an ok photo. Some things that could help it be better: Less distracting background, especially the lighter areas (to get this, you could have cropped and then used some advanced editing techniques to turn down background brightness).', '2010-07-19 11:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
