(6097673, 898137, 112739, '<td valign="top">Love it.</td>', 'Love it.', '2010-07-19 22:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6097677, 898232, 112739, '<td valign="top">Hard to get this type of flower in total focus. Plus the light is a bit harsh and the background is a bit distracting. Love the color of the columbine though. I just bought a Plamp for holding flowers while you take the photo. It''s about $30 and works great! I can put the flower where I want it and it holds still so you can get a good background and not worry about the wind blowing it around. It doesn''t do any damage to the flower. Look on B&amp;H website.</td>', 'Hard to get this type of flower in total focus. Plus the light is a bit harsh and the background is a bit distracting. Love the color of the columbine though. I just bought a Plamp for holding flowers while you take the photo. It''s about $30 and works great! I can put the flower where I want it and it holds still so you can get a good background and not worry about the wind blowing it around. It doesn''t do any damage to the flower. Look on B&H website.', '2010-07-19 22:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6097678, 897523, 112739, '<td valign="top">Lovely finish. Great depth and detail.</td>', 'Lovely finish. Great depth and detail.', '2010-07-19 22:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
