(6097728, 898147, 112739, '<td valign="top">I think you missed the focus on the face. It''s great on the coat below the head. Would like to see all in focus. Cat''s are hard to capture. They move too quick and you need a fast shutter speed with good light. Can tell he was licking his lips which may have caused the OOF.</td>', 'I think you missed the focus on the face. It''s great on the coat below the head. Would like to see all in focus. Cat''s are hard to capture. They move too quick and you need a fast shutter speed with good light. Can tell he was licking his lips which may have caused the OOF.', '2010-07-19 22:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6097730, 898140, 68947, '<td valign="top">How many years later and his eyes still make me melt! :)</td>', 'How many years later and his eyes still make me melt! :)', '2010-07-19 22:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
