(6098039, 897984, 67697, '<td valign="top">Funny that you did this.  I like that your model looks so much more real than the original.  I miss the softness of the original.  This is a great interpretation but that square object that she is resting her cheek on doesn''t flow with the rest of the curvy material.</td>', 'Funny that you did this.  I like that your model looks so much more real than the original.  I miss the softness of the original.  This is a great interpretation but that square object that she is resting her cheek on doesn''t flow with the rest of the curvy material.', '2010-07-20 10:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6098044, 898209, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like that she is smiling in this one but I think the original is better. I''d like to have seen this as a vertical portrait that would not cut off so much of her face.  The pixelation is too high (or it was too noisy of a photo) and maybe there is some blur?  I hope you put in your photog notes what you wanted to change for this time around - I''m curious to read about it.</td>', 'I like that she is smiling in this one but I think the original is better. I''d like to have seen this as a vertical portrait that would not cut off so much of her face.  The pixelation is too high (or it was too noisy of a photo) and maybe there is some blur?  I hope you put in your photog notes what you wanted to change for this time around - I''m curious to read about it.', '2010-07-20 10:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6098048, 897940, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like that there are more elements than just grass in this one.  I can''t totally tell but it looks like there''s too much sharpening plus extra noise reducer to over compensate for it.  This makes it look overprocessed in that sense.</td>', 'I like that there are more elements than just grass in this one.  I can''t totally tell but it looks like there''s too much sharpening plus extra noise reducer to over compensate for it.  This makes it look overprocessed in that sense.', '2010-07-20 10:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6098052, 898230, 67697, '<td valign="top">much prettier interpretation of the original.  cool looking background but it kind of overwhelms the vase and flowers.  it steals the show from your subject.</td>', 'much prettier interpretation of the original.  cool looking background but it kind of overwhelms the vase and flowers.  it steals the show from your subject.', '2010-07-20 10:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
