(6098101, 898241, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure what to do with this one. It''s a spectacular photo, yet it doesn''t seem to have absolutely nothing in common with the original, except that it''s the same subject. Which seems to stretch the definition of the challenge. Yet normally I''m pretty open minded about challenges. So I decided to write this long comment instead of voting, at the moment. Because I can''t see voting this down, and I can''t vote it high (although I''m waffling on that point). But I thought I''d share these thoughts in case you were getting low votes on this--because it is an absolutely wonderful shot.</td>', 'I''m not quite sure what to do with this one. It''s a spectacular photo, yet it doesn''t seem to have absolutely nothing in common with the original, except that it''s the same subject. Which seems to stretch the definition of the challenge. Yet normally I''m pretty open minded about challenges. So I decided to write this long comment instead of voting, at the moment. Because I can''t see voting this down, and I can''t vote it high (although I''m waffling on that point). But I thought I''d share these thoughts in case you were getting low votes on this--because it is an absolutely wonderful shot.', '2010-07-20 12:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
