(6099261, 898073, 20799, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, crisp and yummy! I can almost feel the salt on my fingers just watching it. Also, I love the peanut butter border :-).</td>', 'Beautiful, crisp and yummy! I can almost feel the salt on my fingers just watching it. Also, I love the peanut butter border :-).', '2010-07-21 05:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099345, 898140, 40391, '<td valign="top">Six years older boy than the original boy from a photo taken four years ago so I''m guessing it''s a different boy and most likely a different photog.  The lighting suffured in the original but not with this shot.  The focus on the eye is perfect and the B&amp;W works very well.  Great shot.</td>', 'Six years older boy than the original boy from a photo taken four years ago so I''m guessing it''s a different boy and most likely a different photog.  The lighting suffured in the original but not with this shot.  The focus on the eye is perfect and the B&W works very well.  Great shot.', '2010-07-21 09:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099349, 898175, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice twist on the original.  Very good lighting - captures the OLD #13 ball well :-)</td>', 'Nice twist on the original.  Very good lighting - captures the OLD #13 ball well :-)', '2010-07-21 09:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099354, 898181, 40391, '<td valign="top">A great improvement and excellent photo.  Some talk lately about the overuse of whine glasses in challenges but a good photo is a good photo and should be voted as one IMHO.</td>', 'A great improvement and excellent photo.  Some talk lately about the overuse of whine glasses in challenges but a good photo is a good photo and should be voted as one IMHO.', '2010-07-21 09:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099360, 898236, 40391, '<td valign="top">Way to go to improve on a Red Ribbon winner!</td>', 'Way to go to improve on a Red Ribbon winner!', '2010-07-21 09:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099379, 897523, 40391, '<td valign="top">Great shot!.  Exact same location but better composed and excellent PP. I''m guessing we''ll see this place again for the Industrial II challenge?</td>', 'Great shot!.  Exact same location but better composed and excellent PP. I''m guessing we''ll see this place again for the Industrial II challenge?', '2010-07-21 09:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
