(6099389, 898044, 67697, '<td valign="top">interesting interpretation.  i like how the glass seems to be floating.  i actually prefer the lighting and white balance of the original, plus that the apple skin is more prominent there too.</td>', 'interesting interpretation.  i like how the glass seems to be floating.  i actually prefer the lighting and white balance of the original, plus that the apple skin is more prominent there too.', '2010-07-21 09:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099393, 898038, 40391, '<td valign="top">Should have used the camera flash to capture that spirit again but that may have made him angry ;-)<br/> <br/>Lovely capture and clear enough to see on his nose the result of recent battles.</td>', 'Should have used the camera flash to capture that spirit again but that may have made him angry ;-) Lovely capture and clear enough to see on his nose the result of recent battles.', '2010-07-21 09:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099394, 898220, 67697, '<td valign="top">not a bad interpretation.  i like how the criss-cross patterns are more apparent in this.  just that the way you set it up, the intersection leads my eye to the empty space, and the photo seems incomplete.  with the original, the empty space leads me to the intersection.  yeah, sounds weird, so sorry lol.</td>', 'not a bad interpretation.  i like how the criss-cross patterns are more apparent in this.  just that the way you set it up, the intersection leads my eye to the empty space, and the photo seems incomplete.  with the original, the empty space leads me to the intersection.  yeah, sounds weird, so sorry lol.', '2010-07-21 09:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099401, 898229, 40391, '<td valign="top">Much better lighting and perspective - well done!</td>', 'Much better lighting and perspective - well done!', '2010-07-21 09:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099408, 898260, 67697, '<td valign="top">yes, a better interpretation of the original.  i like that you chose to include a background to supplement the subject.</td>', 'yes, a better interpretation of the original.  i like that you chose to include a background to supplement the subject.', '2010-07-21 10:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099422, 898259, 67697, '<td valign="top">even tho the original was for a "bad" challenge, this is a good re-do. no date stamp (lol), looks good in color, no flash, and i like the focus on the coins.</td>', 'even tho the original was for a "bad" challenge, this is a good re-do. no date stamp (lol), looks good in color, no flash, and i like the focus on the coins.', '2010-07-21 10:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099429, 898114, 67697, '<td valign="top">this is pretty, and i like the soft lighting, but I prefer Librodo''s shot.  the crop focuses purely on the flower where here, you have extra elements (in particular the top left) that don''t add anything to the shot.</td>', 'this is pretty, and i like the soft lighting, but I prefer Librodo''s shot.  the crop focuses purely on the flower where here, you have extra elements (in particular the top left) that don''t add anything to the shot.', '2010-07-21 10:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6099985, 897984, 80904, '<td valign="top">LoL, you had to do this Judi. Too funny. Hopefully it will score as good as the original.</td>', 'LoL, you had to do this Judi. Too funny. Hopefully it will score as good as the original.', '2010-07-21 16:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
