(6101857, 898003, 104009, '<td valign="top">if you''d have called it "deadlights"  i''d have scored 2 points higher than the 7 i''m giving you.  great shot.</td>', 'if you''d have called it "deadlights"  i''d have scored 2 points higher than the 7 i''m giving you.  great shot.', '2010-07-23 09:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
