(6103360, 897971, 100831, '<td valign="top">Sorry there are just too many pictures titled Sunflower. I can''t vote if I don''t know the original from whence this came.<br/>So now I know... EXCELLENT retake. The other one was closely cropped to suit the round challenge, I guess, but yours works for round too. It''s still bright and sunny with the focus aimed right at the middle. The added bonus of the luscious bokeh and green color surrounding it makes this not just an ordinary sunflower picture. Well done. 9</td>', 'Sorry there are just too many pictures titled Sunflower. I can''t vote if I don''t know the original from whence this came.So now I know... EXCELLENT retake. The other one was closely cropped to suit the round challenge, I guess, but yours works for round too. It''s still bright and sunny with the focus aimed right at the middle. The added bonus of the luscious bokeh and green color surrounding it makes this not just an ordinary sunflower picture. Well done. 9', '2010-07-25 12:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
