(6104625, 898145, 72318, '<td valign="top">Really like the idea with the ripples, does a better job than what the "flood filter" tries to achieve (but never really does it right) in Photoshop - and all in-camera.<br/> <br/>If there was any critique to offer - you have used a very sharp gradient in your selective sharpening / blurring of the area around the flower which detracts from image.  Congrats on yet another ribbon - i fear you may do well in the upcoming minimalism challenge too ;)</td>', 'Really like the idea with the ripples, does a better job than what the "flood filter" tries to achieve (but never really does it right) in Photoshop - and all in-camera. If there was any critique to offer - you have used a very sharp gradient in your selective sharpening / blurring of the area around the flower which detracts from image.  Congrats on yet another ribbon - i fear you may do well in the upcoming minimalism challenge too ;)', '2010-07-26 13:41:41.000000', NULL, 0),
