(6104711, 898258, 93565, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by colorcarnival:</b></div><hr/><i> A new 2nd PB.  You are movin on up!  Congrats! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Nice! You got a new image on your profile page, got your highest numerical placing, and your 3rd highest percentile so far!<br/>Great execution. My favorite part about this photo is the yellow lines on the edges of the palm leaves. The frame the leaves quite well and really make them pop. I''m also fond of the descending height of the leaves in the background.</td>', 'Originally posted by colorcarnival: A new 2nd PB.  You are movin on up!  Congrats!   Nice! You got a new image on your profile page, got your highest numerical placing, and your 3rd highest percentile so far!Great execution. My favorite part about this photo is the yellow lines on the edges of the palm leaves. The frame the leaves quite well and really make them pop. I''m also fond of the descending height of the leaves in the background.', '2010-07-26 15:37:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6104745, 898103, 47541, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by The_Tourist:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Nuzzer:</b></div><hr/><i> I was unable to locate a similar image with a title like this and the challenge description does say "The title should refer to the original" so I have to vote this a DNMC: 1 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Wow.  That''s harsh.  I''m not the sharpest tool in the shed, but I found the original "070108".  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=694291" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/882/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_694291.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/882/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_694291.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/882/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_694291.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yep, my DNMC voting was harsh in this one. I tried using that number as an image id and I tried searching on combinations of the words but didn''t think the number would be the title. I would have voted a 6 if I had found, or was guided to, the original.</td>', 'Originally posted by The_Tourist: Originally posted by Nuzzer: I was unable to locate a similar image with a title like this and the challenge description does say "The title should refer to the original" so I have to vote this a DNMC: 1   Wow.  That''s harsh.  I''m not the sharpest tool in the shed, but I found the original "070108".    Yep, my DNMC voting was harsh in this one. I tried using that number as an image id and I tried searching on combinations of the words but didn''t think the number would be the title. I would have voted a 6 if I had found, or was guided to, the original.', '2010-07-26 16:28:39.000000', NULL, 0),
